# Pinned WebAssembly toolchain. Every C -> wasm build runs in this image.
#
# Resolved 2026-10-08 via the Docker Hub registry API
# (digest of the multi-arch manifest list for emscripten/emsdk:6.0.10).
# 6.0.10 is the current stable Emscripten release (2026-09-21; the 6.0.11
# tag is still in development).
# To bump: pick a newer stable tag on https://hub.docker.com/r/emscripten/emsdk/tags,
# resolve its digest the same way, and update this line AND the matching
# `env.EMSDK_IMAGE` in .github/workflows/build-deploy.yml (CI fails if they differ).
EMSDK_IMAGE=emscripten/emsdk:6.0.10@sha256:e077d54e2b8970575ebc4f185ac1de0b95c05f2b266134d4ba27449af7aebf65

# Inside the image (6.0.10):
# - clang / llc / wasm-ld from the LLVM bundled with emscripten 6.0.x,
#   under /emsdk/upstream/bin and on PATH.
# - emcc 6.0.10, also on PATH.
# - node v24.19.0 (see the PATH in emsdk's docker/Dockerfile at tag 6.0.10).
#   Kept in sync with .nvmrc and package.json engines.node; CI asserts it.
